  "reading": {
   "title": "Hafsa's busy week",
   "text": "Hafsa has a busy week. On Monday she has an English class at 6:00 p.m. On Tuesday she goes to the school office to meet Mr. Brown. The meeting is at 10:30 in the morning. The school is far, so she takes the bus. The bus leaves at 9:45 and arrives at 10:15.\n\nOn Wednesday there is no class. Hafsa cleans the house and calls Linda. On Thursday Emre has a school event. It starts at 3:00 p.m., so Hafsa arrives early. She wants a good seat.\n\nOn Saturday Hafsa visits the library. It opens at 9:00 and closes at 5:00. She wants to borrow three books. The weekend is her time to read. She is happy and a little nervous about next month.",
   "glossary": [
    {
     "en": "event",
     "tr": "etkinlik"
    },
    {
     "en": "seat",
     "tr": "yer, koltuk"
    },
